# Netlify High-Performance Caching & Bandwidth Saver Headers

# Immutable long-term caching for hashed JS/CSS assets (saves 95%+ bandwidth on returning visits)
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# Static images and icons cached for 30 days
/assets/images/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000, stale-while-revalidate=86400

# HTML entry points always revalidate so deployments update instantly
/index.html
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
